+ * What Windows' Unidrv and PostScript configuration DLLs show: the
+ * printer's features as CPSUI options (Layout, Paper/Quality and the
+ * Advanced tree for a document; Device Settings for the printer), and
+ * the maker's UI plug-ins, from the documented plug-in interfaces
+ * (prcomoem.h, printoem.h): IPrintOemUI's CommonUIProp adds options to
+ * those pages, its DocumentPropertySheets and DevicePropertySheets add pages
+ * of their own, and HideStandardUI (IPrintOemUI2) lets a plug-in show its
